  "steps": [
    "Chicken plate: Heat the oven to 425°F. Toss the sweet potato with a light spray of oil, salt and pepper and roast 20-25 min until tender. Season the chicken and grill or pan-sear it over medium-high heat 5-7 min per side until 165°F. Steam the broccoli 4-5 min until bright green and tender.",
    "Turkey chili: Brown the turkey in a sprayed skillet over medium-high heat until no pink remains (165°F). Add the beans, tomatoes, chili powder, cumin and a pinch of salt and simmer 10 min.",
    "Omelette + oats: Simmer the oats in the water 5 min, stirring, then stir in the cinnamon and stevia. Wilt the spinach in a sprayed nonstick pan over medium heat, pour in the egg whites, and cook until set, folding the omelette in half.",
    "Salmon plate: Heat the oven to 400°F. Put the salmon and asparagus on a sprayed sheet pan, season, and roast 12-15 min until the salmon flakes and reads 145°F. Saute the cauliflower rice with the garlic in a sprayed skillet over medium-high heat 5 min.",
    "Taco bowl: Brown the beef in a skillet over medium-high heat, breaking it up, until no pink remains (160°F). Stir in the taco seasoning and 2 tbsp water. Build the bowl with the rice, lettuce, beef, salsa and Greek yogurt."
  ],
